{"id":1492489,"slug":"ve-v-konu-slu-by-2012","title":"Ve výkonu služby","title_en":"Line of Duty","year":2012,"rating":85,"votes_count":808,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Když policie vyšetřuje policii. Britská protikorupční jednotka nejde po zločincích z ulice, ale po lidech z vlastních řad. Kriminálka, která vtáhne.(iVysílání)","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBAp7VfKVQKQIiLRJHZSMGtyXAB.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ZLEFPayOJr3KhXPoAnLWdVQJem.jpg","trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Krimi","Drama","Thriller","Mysteriózní"],"tags":[],"countries":["Velká Británie"],"directors":["David Caffrey","Douglas Mackinnon","Michael Keillor","Daniel Nettheim","John Strickland","Jed Mercurio"],"actors":["Martin Compston","Vicky McClure","Adrian Dunbar","Lennie James","Neil Morrissey","Craig Parkinson","Kate Ashfield","Claire Keelan","Owen Teale","Gina McKee","Paul Higgins","Elisa Lasowski","Charlotte Spencer","Claire-Louise Cordwell","Julia Krynke","Heather Craney","Mark Bonnar","Sacha Dhawan","Mary Moulds","Lucy Cray-Miller","Ian Beattie","Niall Cusack","Laurence Doherty","Richard Buick","Richard Doubleday","Desmond Edwards","Roman Beguns","Simon Millar","Alison Lintott","Tony Pitts","Tomi May","Simon Coury","Christina Chong","Darren Morfitt","Adjoa Andoh","Michael Nardone","Vicky Hall","Brian Miller","Melanie Kilburn","Lisa Palfrey","Richard Huw","Leanne Best","Nigel Boyle","Philip Wright","Royce Pierreson","Elizabeth Hill","Sue Kelly","Nick Owenford","Brian McCardie","Keeley Hawes","Steve Toussaint","Liz White","Jeany Spark","Jessica Raine","Claire Hackett","Andrea Irvine","Shaun Mason","Daniel Mays","Will Mellor","Shaun Parkes","Arsher Ali","Aiysha Hart","Rebecca O'Mara","Polly Walker","Jonas Armstrong","George Costigan","Shashi Rami","David Ryan","Paul Kennedy","Lee Ingleby","Gaite Jansen","Claudia Jessie","Rhodri Lewis","Henry Priest Miller","Thandiwe Newton","Mark Stobbart","Jason Watkins","Patrick FitzSymons","Andy Kellegher","Patrick Baladi","Chris Coghill","Mary Healey","Mark Quigley","Chris Wilson","Poppy Miller","Tara Lynne O'Neill","Stephen Graham","Amy De Bhrún","Rosa Escoda","Karolina Koziol","Rochenda Sandall","Joanne Crawford","David Maybrick","Brian Ferguson","Sian Reese-Williams","Scott Reid","Laura Elphinstone","Antonio Magro","Natalie Gavin","Harriet Cains","Barry Aird","Lucie Shorthouse","Kelly Macdonald","Shalom Brune-Franklin","Chetna Pandya","Loreece Harrison","Maya Sondhi","Jimmy Savile","Tara Flynn","Carolyn Bracken","Victoria Carling","India Amarteifio","Colette Lennon Dougal","Faraz Ayub","Stefan Boehm","Ash Cook","Ross Moneypenny","Terry Noble","Robert Carlyle","Tom Weston-Jones"],"screenwriters":["Jed Mercurio"],"cinematographers":["Ruairí O'Brien","Stephen Murphy","Ray Carlin","Anna Valdez-Hanks"],"composers":["Carly Paradis"],"reviews":[{"author":"laik_60","text":"Celý seriál poukazuje na množstvo byrokracie , ľahostajnosti v policajnom aparáte, nehovoriac o karierizme a predovšetkým malých i veľkých prehreškov (korupcia, ba aj trestná činnosť) vyšších dôstojníkov. Naša polícia vyzerá v porovnaní s nimi ako zbor anjelov. :) (alebo je to aj inde takto,). Napriek tomu seriál je pozerateľný, má svižnosť a spád - nenudí.(11.07.2020)","stars":5},{"author":"tahit","text":"Ústřední trio z protikorupční jednotky AC-12 funguje jako beranidlo, které bez milosti boří mýtus o neomylnosti strážců zákona. Scénář mistrně buduje napětí. Každý výslech se mění v tikající bombu, která ohrožuje i ta nejvyšší místa na policejním ředitelství. Výsledkem je atmosférická a nesmírně dynamická podívaná. Seriál úspěšně křísí ducha kultovních Profesionálů z CI5, ale převléká je do moderního, mnohem psychologičtějšího kabátu. Je to zkrátka skvělá jízda, která se mi zavrtala pod kůži a ještě dlouho v ní zůstane.(05.07.2026)","stars":5},{"author":"j.sorensen","text":"Hezký, jak se s každou novou řadou, mění poměr barevní vs bílí, o ženách vs mužích, nemluvě. Přitom standardní britská policejníjednotka, vypadá úplně jinak, než by si tvůrci přáli a jak nám pokrytecky cpou...(01.08.2026)","stars":3}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-a51ce5c5-27fc-45bc-bc20-030ca8c7bac1"},{"platform":"iVysílání","url":"https://www.ceskatelevize.cz/porady/17054374070-ve-vykonu-sluzby?utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=section_vod&utm_campaign=link"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/travelhd:2026052966e0e985a6a4750efe7c84e4c390ee38"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/320721-ve-vykonu-sluzby/prehled/","csfd_id":320721,"root_id":320721,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":7,"episode_count":42,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}